<div class="info-card">
<div class="info-card-emoji">⭐</div>
<div><span class="info-label">Centro de interés</span> <span class="info-value">Fracciones</span></div>
</div>
<div class="info-card">
<div class="info-card-emoji">🎓</div>
<div><span class="info-label">Nivel</span> <span class="info-value">3º de ESO <small>(ACS 1º ESO)</small></span></div>
</div>
